In the Spoiler Sheet, one of the items suggested for wishing is:
     blessed +3 Hawaiian shirt
Why is this valuable? Is it merely because it may be worn beneath a suit of
armor (thus give you another kicker of 3 points of AC)? Or does a Hawaiian
shirt do anything else? I know that a Tourist starts with one, and it's
base adjustment to AC is 0. I have gotten quite a few through poly-piling,
but saw no big use for them.


