Also, the spoiler sheet does not mention the usefulness of a blessed
magic marker. When writing on a blank scroll or when 'E'ngraving the E-word,
I believe it uses less charges when blessed. Also using a blessed magic marker
on a blank scroll will create the desired scroll in a blessed state. I haven't
tried it, but I assume a cursed magic marker is similar in creating cursed
scrolls (ie: genocide, teleportation [for level teleport]).


In the "DEAD MONSTERS:", eating which corpses will poison you or % chance
